  "name": "Westfall rare elites award elite kill experience",
  "contract": "The Ascension creaturecache.wdb captures (up to 2026-09-05) give the Westfall rares Vultros 462, Sergeant Brashclaw 506, Slark 519, Brack 520, Leprithus 572, Foe Reaper 4000 573 and Master Digger 1424 rank 2 (rare elite); the server carried rank 4 (rare), which Creature::isElite excludes. An elite kill multiplies the base gain by Rate.XP.Elite 1.44 (Formulas.cpp). An elite kill therefore awards about 1.44 times a normal kill of the same level whatever Rate.XP.Kill and Rate.XP.Global are (truncation keeps the ratio within 1.41-1.46: 210/146 with the shipped rates, 193/134 with Rate.XP.Kill 1), and a rank-4 rare awards the same as a normal kill. Foe Reaper 4000 is level 20 natively and Vultros is pinned to level 20 so both share the base gain of 145; neither has a per-creature experience modifier. The warrior carries melee_hit_rating, expertise_rating and melee_crit_rating 10000 for the reason given in xp-ascension-rates.json: none of them enters the XP calculation.",
